Here I detail my research projects and data pipelines applied to political economy and public finance.





&lt;h5 class="card-title"&gt;Budget Gatekeepers & Federal Transfers&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;p class="card-text"&gt;Deciphering the mechanisms of federal public budget articulation through econometric modeling and Network Analysis. Investigates party bargaining power and "coalition bonuses" in resource distribution to Brazilian municipalities by mapping bipartisan financial flows and calculating Betweenness Centrality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="mt-auto"&gt;
  &lt;span class="badge bg-secondary"&gt;R&lt;/span&gt;
