  &lt;span class="badge bg-secondary text-warning"&gt;PRIVATE&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;div class="text-end mt-3"&gt;&lt;a href="budget-gatekeepers.qmd" class="btn btn-outline-dark btn-sm stretched-link"&gt;Read Case Study&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;






&lt;h5 class="card-title"&gt;Administrative Unilateralism in Latin America&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;p class="card-text"&gt;Large-scale computational research investigating institutional dynamics across Brazil, Argentina, Chile, Peru, Colombia, and Paraguay. Involves developing automated web scraping bots to extract over 150,000 normative acts and applying NLP (Named Entity Recognition) to decode raw official decrees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="mt-auto"&gt;
  &lt;span class="badge bg-secondary"&gt;Python&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class="badge bg-secondary"&gt;NLP&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class="badge bg-secondary text-warning"&gt;PRIVATE&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;div class="text-end mt-3"&gt;&lt;a href="administrative-unilateralism.qmd" class="btn btn-outline-dark btn-sm stretched-link"&gt;Read Case Study&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;






&lt;h5 class="card-title"&gt;Stakeholder Mapping: Fiscal Framework&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;p class="card-text"&gt;Quantitative assessment of political risk and transaction costs in the National Congress. Modeled roll-call votes for the Fiscal Framework (PLP 93/2023) using the Jaccard Similarity Index and Louvain clustering to detect invisible behavioral caucuses and strategic gatekeepers.&lt;/p&gt;
